---
// 3-column methodology grid: Architect (ME) / Executor (AI) / Platform (STACK)
---

<section class="scope" id="methodology">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="ebar"></span>
        <span data-en>/ How I build</span>
        <span data-es>/ Cómo construyo</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <span data-en>The AI writes code. <span class="muted">It doesn't decide.</span></span>
        <span data-es>La IA escribe código. <span class="muted">No decide.</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        <span data-en>Decisions, schema and code review are mine. Execution goes to agents, but with tests in between, because without that the speed comes back to bite you. Took me about a year to get this flow right.</span>
        <span data-es>Las decisiones, el schema y el code review los hago yo. La ejecución la delego en agentes, pero con tests de por medio, porque sin eso la velocidad se te devuelve. Me tomó como un año armar este flujo.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="meth-grid">
      <div class="meth-col">
        <div class="meth-role" data-en>01 · Architect · ME</div>
        <div class="meth-role" data-es>01 · Arquitecto · YO</div>
        <div class="meth-mark"><span class="ac">E</span>D<span class="ac">.</span></div>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-en>First question: where does it hurt?</h3>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-es>Primera pregunta: ¿dónde duele?</h3>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-en>Before writing anything I sit with whoever has the problem and watch how they actually work. The bottleneck is almost never where people say it is. From there comes the spec, the schema, and what ships first.</p>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-es>Antes de escribir nada me siento con quien tiene el problema y miro cómo trabaja en realidad. El cuello de botella casi nunca está donde te dicen. De ahí sale el spec, el schema y qué se shippea primero.</p>
        <ul class="meth-list">
          <li data-en>Business framing → product spec</li>
          <li data-es>Framing de negocio → spec de producto</li>
          <li data-en>Schema + boundary design</li>
          <li data-es>Diseño de schema + boundaries</li>
          <li data-en>PR review, every commit</li>
          <li data-es>PR review, todo commit</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="meth-col">
        <div class="meth-role" data-en>02 · Executor · AI</div>
        <div class="meth-role" data-es>02 · Ejecutor · IA</div>
        <div class="meth-mark">A<span class="ac">I</span></div>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-en>Agents execute, with rules.</h3>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-es>Los agentes ejecutan, con reglas.</h3>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-en>Claude Code, Cursor, Codex. Each one gets a scoped task and a test to pass, and nothing merges without me reading it. That review is basically the reason this works.</p>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-es>Claude Code, Cursor, Codex. Cada uno recibe una tarea acotada y un test que pasar, y nada se mergea sin que yo lo lea. Esa revisión es básicamente la razón de que esto funcione.</p>
        <ul class="meth-list">
          <li>Claude Code · Cursor · Codex</li>
          <li data-en>Scoped prompts, no vibe-coding</li>
          <li data-es>Prompts acotados, sin vibe-coding</li>
          <li data-en>Test-gated PRs</li>
          <li data-es>PRs con test-gate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="meth-col">
        <div class="meth-role" data-en>03 · Platform · STACK</div>
        <div class="meth-role" data-es>03 · Plataforma · STACK</div>
        <div class="meth-mark">TS<span class="ac">/</span></div>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-en>A boring, durable stack.</h3>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-es>Un stack aburrido y durable.</h3>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-en>TypeScript, Supabase, Astro or Next depending on the project. Nothing exotic, because when something breaks in production I want to already know where to look.</p>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-es>TypeScript, Supabase, Astro o Next según el proyecto. Nada exótico, porque cuando algo se rompe en producción quiero saber de antemano dónde mirar.</p>
        <ul class="meth-list">
          <li>TypeScript · React · Astro 5</li>
          <li>Supabase · Postgres · RLS</li>
          <li>WhatsApp Cloud API · GSAP</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section.scope {
    position: relative;
    padding: 140px 0 32px;
  }
  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 72px;
    max-width: 880px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5.4vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
  }
  .section-title :global(.muted) {
    color: var(--color-text-3);
  }
  .section-lede {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-3);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .eyebrow .ebar {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 3px;
    height: 11px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    animation: blink 1.2s steps(2, start) infinite;
  }

  .meth-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--color-hair);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hair);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .meth-col {
    background: var(--color-surface-1);
    padding: 40px 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 200ms;
  }
  .meth-col:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface-2);
  }
  .meth-role {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .meth-mark {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 88px;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .meth-mark .ac {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .meth-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .meth-desc {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .meth-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: auto 0 0;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-hair-strong);
    padding-top: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .meth-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 18px 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .meth-list li::before {
    content: "→";
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .meth-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
